<DocsExample TExample="FabMenuBasicExample" Title="Button items" Description="NTFabMenuButtonItem entries run a callback. A FAB menu needs between two and six items, and Icon and AriaLabel are required." />
<DocsExample TExample="FabMenuLinksExample" Title="Link items" Description="NTFabMenuAnchorItem renders a link with Href, and can be mixed with button items." />
<DocsExample TExample="FabMenuExpandedExample" Title="Opening from code" Description="OpenAsync and CloseAsync open or close the menu from code. OnExpandedChanged reports every change, including ones the user makes with the FAB, an item, Escape, or a click outside." />
